WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.909
The Merlo-Davidson settlement: over one hundred and twenty-five million dollars for sexual harassment.

00:00:05.909 --> 00:00:12.056
Three thousand one hundred and thirty-one validated claims across more than forty years of institutional abuse.

00:00:12.056 --> 00:00:17.443
Total harassment settlements including the Tiller settlement: two hundred and twenty-one million dollars.

00:00:17.443 --> 00:00:21.965
April 2020: twenty-two people killed in the Nova Scotia mass shooting.

00:00:21.965 --> 00:00:26.795
The RCMP failed to issue a province-wide Alert Ready despite functional capacity.

00:00:26.795 --> 00:00:31.499
Over four thousand complaints backlogged at the Civilian Review and Complaints Commission.

00:00:31.499 --> 00:00:34.170
One thousand officer positions unfilled.

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:37.931
One hundred and thirty recommendations from the Mass Casualty Commission.

00:00:37.931 --> 00:00:45.022
Over one hundred and fifty years of operation without civilian oversight — an oversight mandate was only created in 2019.

00:00:45.022 --> 00:00:46.727
Reform is not optional.

00:00:46.727 --> 00:00:48.761
It is overdue by decades.
